do_1 = "Decision 2490 (triage record spec/layerx-merge/programme/issues/1577.kvx, verdict task): the open action of apps/wallet/src/surfaces/ExchangeView.tsx (lines 74-84) returns pull 0n, so the approval callback (lines 115-121) never requests an allowance although the perps open call pulls the collateral (precompiles/perps/positions.go:264-271 routes to depositLeg; precompiles/perps/account.go:297-336 checks allowance(owner, precompile) against the amount and transfers it). Set pull to the parsed collateralAmount for the open action and pass the chosen collateralToken to the approval (surfaceModule.approval(owner, collateralToken, pull)), so useModuleSend performs the exact approval first exactly as deposit does."
do_2 = "Update apps/wallet/src/surfaces/ExchangeView.test.tsx (the assertion at lines 122-124 that no allowance lookup happens) so the open case with an allowance below the amount asserts the allowance lookup and an exact approval transaction before the openPosition send, and a case with sufficient allowance asserts no approval; keep every existing encoding assertion."
